SUMMARY:Sparkling Lights at The Breakers
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261122
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
DTSTAMP:20261026T165800Z
UID:d5932912a26459263f74067ed3d2@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Sparkling Lights at The Breakers presented by BankNewport When
 : November 21 &#8211\; December 27\, 2026 from 4:00 - 8:00 PM November 21
 \, 22\, 27\, 28\, and 29 December 3\, 4\, 5\, 6\, 10\, 11\, 12\, 13\, 18\,
  20\, 21\, 22\, 23\, 26\, and 27 Timed Admission: 4:00\, 4:30\, 5:00\, 5:3
 0\, and 6:00 PM (House and grounds will close at 8:00 PM) Where: The Break
 ers\, 44 Ochre Point Avenue\, Newport Tickets: $45 Adult Non-Member $18 Yo
